<div class="mandarin-hanzi">鸡蛋</div>
<div class="mandarin-pinyin">jīdàn</div>

''Meaning:'' egg; chicken egg  
''Part of speech:'' noun

!! In context
我早上吃了两个鸡蛋。 — Wǒ zǎoshang chī le liǎng ge jīdàn. — I ate two eggs this morning.

!! Usage note
鸡蛋 (jīdàn) is a chicken egg, commonly counted with 个: 一个鸡蛋 (yí ge jīdàn, 'one egg'). Compare 鸡蛋 (egg) with 米饭 (mǐfàn, 'cooked rice').
